German voters headed to the polls on Sunday for a key regional election in the ex-communist east where the far-right, anti-immigrant, Moscow- and Trump-friendly AfD is expected to secure an easy majority. Our correspondent Nick Holdsworth tells us more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8ded9a6e-a9bb-11f1-936f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C7FD9V7.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/8ded9a6e-a9bb-11f1-936f-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/000-C7FD9V7.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">957595b6-a9e8-11f1-b127-791dea6d5b8b</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 11:54:09 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Ethan Hawke receives the Deauville Talent Award</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260906-ethan-hawke-receives-the-deauville-talent-award</link><description>
Known for starring in Dead Poets Society, the Before trilogy and Boyhood, Hollywood legend Ethan Hawke receives the #Deauville #Talent #Award in recognition of his career spanning nearly 40 years.
 
He also plays the lead role in The Weight, screened at the Opening Ceremony of the 52nd Deauville #American #Film #Festival and due to be released in theaters on September 16. Our reporter Gaëlle Fonseca spoke to him on the red carpet.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c899b634-a9e8-11f1-b153-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/SUJET-VOX-POPS-00-11-27-23-Still003.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/c899b634-a9e8-11f1-b153-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/SUJET-VOX-POPS-00-11-27-23-Still003.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">5f54c4b2-a9e7-11f1-a7d9-791dea6d5b8b</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 11:49:35 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>US Army Secretary Dan Driscoll quits: "What we've seen is almost a factional clash"</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260906-us-army-secretary-dan-driscoll-quits-what-we-ve-seen-is-almost-a-factional-clash</link><description>
Amid the US conflict with Iran, Democrats and some Republicans are warning of a leadership void at the top of the US military. That's after the resignation this week of the Army's top civilian official, Army Secretary Dan Driscoll, amid widespread reports of tensions with Defense Secretary Pete Hegseth. Our guest, Walter Ladwig, associate professor of international relations at King's College London, tells us more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/ba4432f2-a9c6-11f1-b81a-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090818-091706-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/ba4432f2-a9c6-11f1-b81a-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090818-091706-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">bf4e72d0-a9c6-11f1-b857-05107f23cd58</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 11:34:46 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><title>🔴 Trump's envoys Witkoff and Kushner arrive in Kyiv after 'substantive' talks with Putin</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-live-trump-s-envoys-head-to-ukraine-after-substantive-talks-with-putin</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">2672e062-a9dc-11f1-9e31-d34d0bee0376</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 10:18:24 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Iran claims strike on US ship in Strait of Hormuz as fighting escalates</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260906-iran-claims-strike-on-us-ship-in-strait-of-hormuz-as-fighting-escalates</link><description>
Iran said Sunday it struck an unmanned U.S. vessel trying to enter the Strait of Hormuz, the latest salvo in a new flare-up of fighting between the two countries.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c5832ce-a9c4-11f1-8ecd-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090622-090816-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7c5832ce-a9c4-11f1-8ecd-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090622-090816-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">80f72f92-a9c4-11f1-8d82-d1ea6d4a47c2</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 09:04:13 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Nepal floods: Search operations enter 12th day</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260906-nepal-floods-search-operations-enter-12th-day</link><description>
Nepali rescuers faced challenging conditions on Sunday as search operations following catastrophic floods entered their 12th day, buoyed by the extraordinary rescue of four survivors.
 
The disaster has also affected infrastructure and roads. Our correspondent Shahzaib Wahlah tells us more.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/40af19c4-a9d1-11f1-81cf-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-100602-100730-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/40af19c4-a9d1-11f1-81cf-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-100602-100730-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">45c57c46-a9d1-11f1-8069-a327c3f340e1</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 09:03:10 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>Germany's far-right AfD clear frontrunner in eastern state vote</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260906-germany-s-far-right-afd-clear-frontrunner-in-eastern-state-vote</link><description>
German voters headed to the polls Sunday for a crucial regional election in the ex-communist east where the far-right, anti-immigration and Moscow-friendly AfD is expected to win easily.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/aa868b06-a9c3-11f1-b003-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090203-090348-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/aa868b06-a9c3-11f1-b003-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-090203-090348-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">af47d7b2-a9c3-11f1-bac7-05107f23cd58</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 08:59:26 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Middle East</category><title>Israeli strikes kill four in Lebanon after alleged Hezbollah drone launch</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20260906-israeli-strikes-kill-four-in-lebanon-after-alleged-hezbollah-drone-launch</link><description>
Israeli air strikes on southern Lebanon Sunday killed four people, two of them women, the country's health ministry said. Israel's military said that the strikes were a response to an alleged Hezbollah drone launch targeting troops in the Israeli-occupied "security zone" in the country's south.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2b6c4208-a9cc-11f1-97b3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26249260716697.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2b6c4208-a9cc-11f1-97b3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26249260716697.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">60dd8fba-a9cb-11f1-b90f-a327c3f340e1</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 08:49:41 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/2b6c4208-a9cc-11f1-97b3-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26249260716697.jpg">© Mohammed Zaatari, AP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Asia / Pacific</category><title>Eight airports in Indonesia suspend operations after volcanic eruption</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/asia-pacific/20260906-six-airports-in-indonesia-suspend-operations-after-volcanic-eruption</link><description>
Eight airports in Indonesia, including Jakarta's main international airport, suspended operations Sunday after the erupting Anak Krakatoa volcano spewed clouds of ash across the archipelago. Geologists said that the latest series of eruptions does not have the potential to trigger a tsunami at this time.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7973d472-a9c0-11f1-a0ea-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/7a7569133a3d2c491f8f59c7f29eff6f7bc0b4e0.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7973d472-a9c0-11f1-a0ea-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/7a7569133a3d2c491f8f59c7f29eff6f7bc0b4e0.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7ac58c12-a9c0-11f1-8628-b7773d79cef0</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 06:59:17 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/7973d472-a9c0-11f1-a0ea-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/7a7569133a3d2c491f8f59c7f29eff6f7bc0b4e0.jpg">© Ronald Siagian, AFP</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>'A bad sign': US envoys head to Kyiv after three-hour talks with Putin</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/a-bad-sign-us-envoys-head-to-kyiv-after-three-hour-talks-with-putin</link><description>
As US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner head to Kyiv following what the White House described as "substantive" talks with Russian President Vladimir Putin, FRANCE 24 correspondent Gulliver Cragg talks about what he describes as a climate of scepticism in Ukraine that these latest negotiations could bring a long-awaited breakthrough.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/51c556be-a9b9-11f1-a995-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-070111-070526-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/51c556be-a9b9-11f1-a995-005056bfb2b6/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260906-070111-070526-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">565fcc18-a9b9-11f1-907c-275248e6db97</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 06:18:30 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Germany's far-right AfD eyes historic state victory in Saxony-Anhalt election</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-germany-s-far-right-afd-eyes-historic-state-victory-in-saxony-anhalt-election</link><description>
Germany's anti-immigrant Alternative for Germany party is aiming to become the first far-right party to take power at a state level since World War II as voters in the eastern German state of Saxony-Anhalt head to the polls Sunday. However, a failure to secure an absolute majority may see the politically isolated party struggle to form a government. 
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d4191ae4-a9b2-11f1-9431-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-05T175805Z-834783995-RC25DNA1ZV3U-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ELECTION-SAXONY-ANHALT-AFD-RALLY.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d4191ae4-a9b2-11f1-9431-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-05T175805Z-834783995-RC25DNA1ZV3U-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ELECTION-SAXONY-ANHALT-AFD-RALLY.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">533da8b8-a9b2-11f1-af2b-b91a3278f929</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 05:52:06 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/d4191ae4-a9b2-11f1-9431-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-05T175805Z-834783995-RC25DNA1ZV3U-RTRMADP-3-GERMANY-ELECTION-SAXONY-ANHALT-AFD-RALLY.jpg">© Fabrizio Bensch, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Europe</category><title>Live: Trump's envoys arrive in Kyiv after 'substantive' talks with Putin</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/europe/20260906-live-trump-s-envoys-head-to-ukraine-after-substantive-talks-with-putin</link><description>
American envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner discussed "substantive plans" for next steps to end the war in Ukraine during their meeting with Russian President Vladimir Putin in Moscow, the White House said, before they headed to Kyiv on Sunday. Kremlin aide Yuri Ushakov said the three-hour talks had been "highly useful" but gave no indication that a breakthrough had been reached. Follow our liveblog for all the latest updates.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/933fb51c-a9dc-11f1-b342-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-06T101623Z-1424650965-RC2MDNAISSXC-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-USA-ENVOYS-ARRIVAL.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/933fb51c-a9dc-11f1-b342-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-06T101623Z-1424650965-RC2MDNAISSXC-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-USA-ENVOYS-ARRIVAL.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">a8dcf760-a9ad-11f1-ac22-9f283cb570fc</guid><pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 04:57:43 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/933fb51c-a9dc-11f1-b342-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-09-06T101623Z-1424650965-RC2MDNAISSXC-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-USA-ENVOYS-ARRIVAL.jpg">© Alina Smutko, Reuters</source><dc:creator>FRANCE 24</dc:creator></item><item><category>Spotlight</category><title>Witkoff: Putin’s Messenger?</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/tv-shows/spotlight/20260905-witkoff-putin-s-messenger</link><description>
