</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/49dd8cc6-a952-11f1-b89a-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/RUSSIA-US-UKRAINE-DIPLOMACY-CONFLICT.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/49dd8cc6-a952-11f1-b89a-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/RUSSIA-US-UKRAINE-DIPLOMACY-CONFLICT.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">7e0dcbcc-a949-11f1-8a60-19aaef7307d6</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 18:02:24 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>Gavin LEE</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title>The closely-watched Lindsay Clancy trial ends with one last dramatic moment</title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260905-the-closely-watched-lindsay-clancy-trial-ends-with-one-last-dramatic-moment</link><description>
The closely watched case of the Massachusetts mother who killed her three young children was on the verge of being declared a mistrial Friday — but there was still one more dramatic moment to come.
</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b557d568-a909-11f1-9359-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260905-100921-101116-CS.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.france24.com/media/display/b557d568-a909-11f1-9359-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/EN-20260905-100921-101116-CS.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">b9d0ac0a-a909-11f1-ae25-79a19839b1c1</guid><pubDate>Sat, 05 Sep 2026 16:31:52 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>FRANCE24</dc:creator></item><item><category></category><title><![CDATA['Wallace & Gromit' creators turn 50 with spook-tacular Shaun yarn]]></title><link>https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260905-wallace-gromit-creators-turn-50-with-spook-tacular-shaun-yarn</link><description>
